OL,3,GNEWSAExperts battling extinctions after
OL,4,Arecord heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FScientists hope to prevent the
OL,7,Fextinction of some rare species by
OL,8,Ftrying to understand their changing
OL,9,Fneeds, as the UK nears the end of its
OL,10,Fhottest-ever summer.
OL,12,FUsing money from Natural England and
OL,13,Fthe Crown Estate, the Royal
OL,14,FEntomological Society is working with
OL,15,Fother groups to update conservation
OL,16,Fguidance for grassland sites in
OL,17,FGloucestershire, Somerset and Wiltshire
OL,18,Fto study our changing climate.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
