OL,3,GNEWSAExperts battling extinctions after
OL,4,Arecord heat
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Urgent adaptations are needed to
OL,7,Fmitigate the effects of successive
OL,8,Fheatwaves on plants and the insects
OL,9,Fthat rely on them to thrive," the
OL,10,Fsociety said.
OL,12,FIt comes as elsewhere, wetlands created
OL,13,Fat the National Trust's Holnicote
OL,14,FEstate have helped to store water,
OL,15,Freduce flooding, and boost wildlife.
